slug: x402-facilitators-all-15-failed-the-reconcile-check
title: x402's facilitators are the trust bottleneck — USENIX tested 15, all 15 failed
description: USENIX Security 2026 (arXiv:2607.19545) tested 15 x402 facilitators and found security-rule violations in all 15. The 'Free Shopping' attack lets the on-chain settled amount diverge from what the facilitator approved — invisible until after you pay. /x402/receipt-verify re-derives the settled USDC amount from two independent Base RPCs and reconciles it against the advertised terms (facilitator_consistency: CONSISTENT | SETTLE_DIVERGENCE | UNVERIFIED), a check that does not trust the facilitator.
